618
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:24,000
Temam. U erebî ew bil bil im.
 
Exactly.

619
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:26,000
Temam. U erebî ew bil bil im.
 
Exactly. And in Arabic I speak like a nightingale.

