...I won't do it, I won't die, I swear, I swear...

701
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Ereqê vexe venexe ez ê vexwim!
 
Drink arak, don't drink, I will drink it!

702
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:37,000
Merheba dayê!
 
Hello mother!

703
