Me go em kê biçin perwerdeyê?
 
We said when are we going to education?

705
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:45,000
Ez zanim ku kê biçin perwerdeyê, ez jî tê biçim perwerdeyê,
 
I know when to go to education, I will go to education too,

706
