708
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,000
Lê anê em dikanin derkevin.
 
But mother, we can go out.

709
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:54,000
Ger anê an wela tu xwe naparêzî.
 
If mother, if, well, you don't protect yourself.

710
