Çi tiştê kes jê dipirse na pirse.
 
Whatever anyone asks her, they don't ask.

713
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Merheba anê.
 
Hello mother.

714
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:07,000
Ehlen, tu çûyî?
 
