725
00:44:28,000 --> 00:44:29,000
Anê na anê bere wisa dibêje aqlê di serê me da ye.
 
No mother, let them say so, the mind is in our head.

726
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:49,000
Yan perwerde! Yan perwerde! Yan perwerde!
 
Either education! Either education! Either education!

727
