731
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:42,000
Heta hefteyeke din em ê dîsa vegerin, bi xatirê we.
 
Until another week we will return again, goodbye.

732
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:19,000
Yarê rakin...
 
Oh beloved, wake up...

733
00:46:19,000 --> 00:46:27,000
Rakin xermanê me rakin...
 
Wake up, start our harvest...

734
00:46:27,000 --> 00:46:33,000
Yarê rakin...
 
Oh beloved, wake up...

735
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:40,000
Hekîmê me rakin...
 
Wake up our doctor...

736
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Rakin rakin rakin rakin rakin...
 
Wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up...

737
00:46:46,000 --> 00:46:52,000
Hekîmê me rakin...
 
Wake up our doctor...

738
00:46:52,000 --> 00:47:01,000
Erê lawo tera felekî lê ye...
 
Yes son, you have a fate...

739
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:08,000
Bi ser çava di letîfe...
 
Upon the eyes, she is elegant...

740
00:47:08,000 --> 00:47:18,000
Bostek çaxavê letîf e, ez nadim bi dinyê tevdayî...
 
A span of the beautiful era, I wouldn't trade it for the
whole world...

741
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:25,000
Welatê min tû canê min... bi şev û roj tu di bîra min da
ye...
 
My country, you are my soul... day and night you are in my
mind...

742
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:33,000
Welatê min pir şêrîn e... bi rez û mêrg û kaniyê re...
 
My country is very sweet... with its vineyards, meadows, and
springs...

743
00:47:33,000 --> 00:47:40,000
Dilê min destiyê te da... rakin hewfa piling û şêran...
 
My heart is in your hands... remove the fear of leopards and
lions...

744
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:48,000
Lema dinalim em revîne, li cem wande, em rûvine...
 
That's why I groan, we fled, next to them, we are foxes...

745
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:55,000
Mala felekê nekeve, kaniya ha bû ko Efrînê ye...
 
May the house of fate not fall, that spring was where Efrîn
is...

746
00:47:55,000 --> 00:48:03,000
Mala zalimê nekeve, li ber destê te hew bibrîne...
 
May the house of the cruel not fall, let it be cut before
your hands...

747
00:48:03,000 --> 00:48:11,000
Paşiyê ev herbê natê, heyfa te be qedera te...
 
In the end this war won't come, pity on you and your fate...

748
00:48:11,000 --> 00:48:16,000
Eceb rûkê çewa bibe, lê te mat im, hew nave wo...
 
I wonder how the face will be, I am amazed by you, it has no
name...

